    "participant": "Wakiso - Nansana west (Market)",
    "baseline": "Holyfarm market is one of the markets that brings together many market vendors to sell their farm products, unfortunately the market had only one hand washing facility and without water nor soap. Some of the people in the market couldn't remember the signs and symptoms of PHE dieases.",
    "event": "During the wheel sessions, most of the people in the market started remembering the signs and symptoms, where to report, how to avoid getting the virus and so on. After engagements with the market leadership,, they agreed to add on the number of hand washing facilities in the market.",
