    "rumor": "At Seeta Central Market, tomato seller said: \"Ebola was brought by government to chase us from this market because they want to build mall.\"Meat seller said: \"Ebola is for rich people who eat in hotels, not for us who eat posho.\"\"Drinking strong waragi / alcohol kills Ebola inside body.\"",
